The node-economy data packs and other JSON data in this directory (*.json, and the generated
manifest in learn-faces/) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0-1.0. They are
measurements. The full text is in ../LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt.

Not covered by that dedication:
- scripts/ is engine code, Apache-2.0 (see scripts/LICENSE).
- learn-faces/<family>/ holds fonts from Google Fonts, each under the OFL.txt beside it.
- families.csv is a snapshot of google/fonts' tags/all/families.csv. It is Google's data, not
  ours; google/fonts publishes no separate licence for it.
